{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49894","headline":"撷芳词 · 无名氏","name":"撷芳词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风摇荡，雨蒙茸，翠条柔弱花头重。\n春衫窄，香肌湿，记得年时，共伊曾[摘]。\n都如梦，何曾共，可怜孤似钗头凤。\n关山隔，晚云碧，燕儿来也，又无消息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}